["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"58. 和吳曉波聊中國企業家小史：如果未來沒有大生意，年輕人不如過自己喜歡的人生 越級創業 匠人型企業家 企業家經濟\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-02-01-zhangxiaojun-未来可能没有大生意-年轻人不如过自己喜欢的人生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f9079ebf8b858216-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">41:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0201</span></div>\n<h2>未來可能沒有大生意，年輕人不如過自己喜歡的人生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">吳曉波把改革開放後的創業者分成六波，第六波最奇怪：高速發展結束、市場飽和、這一代是有產階級的孩子。他判斷未來大部分創業是小創業，AI 有通吃性，不會帶來所有人的機會。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業家</span><span class=\"tag\">創業</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"57. 《繁花》真實版上海90年代：充滿危險氣息的黃河路和股市 T加3 認購證 舉牌 打莊模子\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-01-27-zhangxiaojun-繁花-里的宝瀛大战-原型是一场违规收购/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4d68467a8e18cd21-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0127</span></div>\n<h2>《繁花》裡的寶瀛大戰，原型是一場違規收購</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1993年深圳寶安用三家分公司各買4.5%的延中實業，合計16%才舉牌，規避5%公告線。證監會罰款100萬，卻仍認定收購有效——延中實業真的被買走了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">上海股市</span><span class=\"tag\">繁花</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"55. 與小Lin的線下活動｜不可控週期中，提高微小個體的生命質量 non-farm payroll Content Marketing hikikomori\" href=\"/podcast/p/2024-01-05-zhangxiaojun-你羡慕的大佬都是幸存者-九成创业公司活不过三年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/280eb7bf594893db-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">55:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0105</span></div>\n<h2>你羨慕的大佬都是倖存者，九成創業公司活不過三年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小Lin說大佬的共性是「膽」，敢擔風險。但這是倖存者視角：創業九成的公司活不過三年，跑出來的人承擔的風險被高光遮住了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">內容創作</span><span class=\"tag\">投行</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"53. 從薩特曼的宏大敘事，聊到赴中東掘金的中國人肖像 PIF Z-Line family sector\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-12-24-zhangxiaojun-中东不是风口-是正在上升的长期力量/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08c7382c7eadd89c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1224</span></div>\n<h2>中東不是風口，是正在上升的長期力量</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中東的宏大敘事不是中國式全民創業的狂熱，而是各國人奔著共同機會聚在一起；中國公司靠高效、靈活和定製化切入，但性價比不是首選，符合國家戰略才是。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中東出海</span><span class=\"tag\">全球化</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"52.【職場人性】論嫉妒：人類最禁忌的情感，在職場裡暗湧 up or out 四元框架 Workplace Envy break winner\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-12-15-zhangxiaojun-嫉妒无法被消除-只会换个地方重新长出来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/091a698723799fa8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1215</span></div>\n<h2>嫉妒無法被消除，只會換個地方重新長出來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">你消掉一個引起嫉妒的偏差，人立刻會發明另一個——因為嫉妒的底層是分層，而分層是動物性的、消不掉的。好組織不是消滅嫉妒，是把拉別人下來的能量改成把自己拉上去。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">職場人性</span><span class=\"tag\">組織管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"51. 地緣政治與大國汽車：中國躍居第一齣口國？別浪費大危機 CKD/SKD TPS CVCC 年餘效應\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-12-11-zhangxiaojun-中国汽车出口第一-但日本车企的出海课还没上完/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/77046da3d5a1614f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:16</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1211</span></div>\n<h2>中國汽車出口第一，但日本車企的出海課還沒上完</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國2023年出口441萬輛躍居全球第一，但2012到2020年八年出口總量一直卡在每年100萬臺。日本車企50年代第一次出海美國慘敗，靠70年代石油危機才翻身——危機是機會，但政治風險和經濟風險同等重要。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車出海</span><span class=\"tag\">地緣政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"50. 95後、00後創業者怎麼樣了？他們的生猛、高馬斯克值與現實 SIGGRAPH mesh PMF MVP Citation\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-12-07-zhangxiaojun-95后创业者把马斯克值拉满-但偶像其实是毛主席/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f5167f7df8bbfd36-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1207</span></div>\n<h2>95後創業者把馬斯克值拉滿，但偶像其實是毛主席</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">這波年輕創業者的驅動力不是錢，而是「這東西牛逼就先做」；他們不寫BP、不刷榜、不主動做PR，只在意的圈子裡積累reputation。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI創業</span><span class=\"tag\">AIGC</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"48. OpenAI的權力遊戲：臉譜、硅谷精英政治與諷刺意味 alignment nerdy AB 票機制 OpenAI LP\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-11-21-zhangxiaojun-openai-政变-非营利董事会为何能踢走-ceo/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3d2ee30a56796488-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1121</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI 政變：非營利董事會為何能踢走 CEO</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一個 700 人、成立不到 5 年的公司，6 人非營利董事會行使一次權力就幹成了政變——而它最大的股東微軟連董事會成員都不是。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>13</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span><span class=\"tag\">公司治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"47. 接班百億基金的瑣碎小事：徐小平和他的門徒 IC sourcing carry principal lateral hire imposter\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-11-16-zhangxiaojun-真格交接-徐小平退场后-合伙人收不了年轻人的税/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/498f3b318cf5e723-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:43</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1116</span></div>\n<h2>真格交接：徐小平退場後，合夥人收不了年輕人的稅</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真格用全員 sourcing 和項目個人 ownership 對抗初代優勢的消失——每個 logo 只掛一個人名下，合夥人不能靠決策養尊處優。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">風投</span><span class=\"tag\">真格基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"46. 失去逍遙子的第一個雙十一：詭計、大混戰與小陽謀 shopping mall 海景房 SK 商家\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-11-11-zhangxiaojun-双十一没有逍遥子-平台在分蛋糕-商家在赔本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7e8cca90f911c8b6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>雙十一沒有逍遙子：平臺在分蛋糕，商家在賠本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">雙十一的複雜不是設計出來的，是幾十條行業線各自往一個 APP 上疊玩法疊出來的；平臺拿走約一半，商家一年幾十億盤子只剩幾百萬利潤。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">電商</span><span class=\"tag\">雙十一</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"44. 談諾貝爾經濟獎與40+消失在黃金階梯上的女人 greedy jobs quiet revolution marriage bar statistical discrimination\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-28-zhangxiaojun-女性职场起步领先-生育惩罚却把优势磨光/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/48345482b5ed098b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">53:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1028</span></div>\n<h2>女性職場起步領先，生育懲罰卻把優勢磨光</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">剛畢業時男女就業參與率幾乎一樣，過十年女性就落下來了，再過十幾年又部分回去——這條曲線與生育時間高度吻合。被磨掉的不是能力，是連續的積累。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">性別經濟學</span><span class=\"tag\">生育懲罰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"43.【汽車史話03】從“盛產管理大師”的通用汽車，看美式車企百年榮辱 BU T型車 take home pay Telematics\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-22-zhangxiaojun-通用汽车盛产管理大师-是因为创始人被赶走了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/a723fc2ffc4b4ee2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:13</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1022</span></div>\n<h2>通用汽車盛產管理大師，是因為創始人被趕走了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">創始人杜蘭特被財團掃地出門，反而讓通用成了職業經理人的土壤——斯隆的BU制、德魯克的管理學都長在這裡。家族不放手的福特，則始終沒有職業經理人的位置。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車產業</span><span class=\"tag\">公司治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"42.【汽車史話02】集權者福特與全球第二暢銷T型車的衰落 vertical integration\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-18-zhangxiaojun-t型车曾占全球市场一半-却因19年不换代被通用取代/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70e535c84a96bcfc-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">50:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1018</span></div>\n<h2>T型車曾佔全球市場一半，卻因19年不換代被通用取代</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">福特靠一款車讓普通人買得起汽車，T型車一度佔據全球汽車銷量的一半以上；但正因為它只有一個品種、一個顏色、十九年不換代，消費者沒有換車的理由，市場被通用拿走。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車史</span><span class=\"tag\">福特</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"41.【汽車史話01】世界上第一輛燃油車、女車手和慈禧太后 Red Flag Act Otto cycle Whiz Kids\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-10-15-zhangxiaojun-汽车只是马车上加个发动机-马车公司却一家没活下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e3a530c55a91b164-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">51:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1015</span></div>\n<h2>汽車只是馬車上加個發動機，馬車公司卻一家沒活下來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">汽車不是馬車上加一臺發動機那麼簡單：動力總成換了，整個技術棧和市場跟著換，當年造車廂的馬車公司沒有一家活過百年。今天衡量電動車企，看的是它能不能掌控上游的電池。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車史</span><span class=\"tag\">內燃機</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"38. 和軟銀願景原GP聊聊，大模型全球降溫後，人工智能何去何從 Foundation Model society of minds EV/EBITDA bottom-up\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-08-20-zhangxiaojun-大模型降温不是坏事-是几十年的技术大周期才刚起步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuoUBXM6pd5isyR05NeIM67iuWkr.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0820</span></div>\n<h2>大模型降溫不是壞事，是幾十年的技術大週期才剛起步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">語言大模型只是機器在反芻人類已經消化過的知識，真正的機器智能會直接從世界觀察學習；降溫後堅持做事的人才能走到最後。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型</span><span class=\"tag\">技術週期</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"37. 小冰李笛講點真心話：只做大模型不追求商業模式是很難生存的 API 思維鏈 混合模型 數字員工\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-08-16-zhangxiaojun-把自己定义成大模型公司-是一个都活不了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnxqwlT8vjIuPSZADa32H7miJIKq.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:27:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0816</span></div>\n<h2>把自己定義成大模型公司，是一個都活不了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李笛說大模型公司不是10個死9個，而是界定成大模型公司就一個都活不了——因為創造的價值和收到的錢是兩回事，API 定價貼著成本走，利潤上限只有每千 token 0.2 美分。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">大模型商業模式</span><span class=\"tag\">小冰</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"36.【做個生意吧！】跳向後海的年輕人、酒精和下沉年代 MVP SOP social ladder\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-08-13-zhangxiaojun-跳海不投营销-一个人站进吧台-店外就多20个客人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuxGkqA6GAXjh_BIlCnFoOKcsdUk.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:20:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0813</span></div>\n<h2>跳海不投營銷：一個人站進吧檯，店外就多20個客人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">跳海從不花錢投小紅書和抖音，它的增長引擎是打酒師：請熟客和朋友來站吧檯，一個人站進去，他外面的朋友就會來，店外就多20個人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">社群運營</span><span class=\"tag\">線下連鎖</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"35. 200位GP趕去中東募資？聊聊沙漠上的白袍、主權基金和金錢王國 LP GP family office carry ADQ ADIA\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-08-07-zhangxiaojun-中东主权基金不投小项目-中国gp第一次拿钱要等18个月/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuV_vC10OwhpReAQFOuhE9CyLnsc.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:12:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0807</span></div>\n<h2>中東主權基金不投小項目，中國GP第一次拿錢要等18個月</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中東資本是啞鈴型結構：主權基金和family office兩頭大、中間空。主權基金越來越直投化，要的是反投和產業落地，不是財務回報。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中東</span><span class=\"tag\">主權基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"34. 被忽視的中腰部公司活得還好嗎？他們的慾望、掙扎與天命 Permanent Head Damage BAU cut off\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-07-31-zhangxiaojun-中腰部公司不是小公司-是二级赛道里被忽视的王者/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FiYSbRQi01KRlmSWWKG6LRxCuy1B.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:11</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0731</span></div>\n<h2>中腰部公司不是小公司，是二級賽道里被忽視的王者</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">它們大多是一個千億級二級賽道里的第一或第二名，創始人從不甘心只做中腰部，但賽道出身極大程度上決定了它們的天花板。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中腰部公司</span><span class=\"tag\">二級賽道</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"33.【職場人性】企業內鬥，究竟在鬥什麼？ Silo OGSM integrity organizational awareness resourceful\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-07-19-zhangxiaojun-内斗是显性的-内耗才是组织的慢性自杀/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjqftLodWnQbkGfz6PXrSbug6f1t.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0719</span></div>\n<h2>內鬥是顯性的，內耗才是組織的慢性自殺</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">內鬥看得見、還能吃瓜，內耗看不見、卻被當成制度流程本身；真正拖垮公司的不是誰跟誰鬥，而是資源冗餘、方向缺失下人人追求存在感。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">組織管理</span><span class=\"tag\">職場</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"32. 第一個把查理·芒格引入中國的人和出版風雲 咖啡書 馬爾薩斯陷阱 雙軌分析 系統一\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-07-10-zhangxiaojun-把芒格引入中国的人-出版黄金十年已经落幕/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FstiWBN9vAR6Z3nm50ANn7oX-n4N.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:13:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0710</span></div>\n<h2>把芒格引入中國的人：出版黃金十年已經落幕</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">出版業沒有定價權，京東把圖書當引流品虧著賣，行業幾百億規模在它眼裡只是廣告費。施宏俊說出版會變成邊緣行業，但也會變得更「高貴」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出版</span><span class=\"tag\">芒格</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"31.【趨勢2023】和老範從退潮的內容投資談起 carry BP MR NFT\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-07-03-zhangxiaojun-投资人不再投纯内容-因为内容是马鞍不是千里马/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fre37tkcf2eFEE8QZwWWIDFkIiYP.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0703</span></div>\n<h2>投資人不再投純內容，因為內容是馬鞍不是千里馬</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">內容公司成功率遠高於絕大多數生意，但天花板由產業特質決定：百花齊放意味著集中度低。所以投資人把內容當鞭子，去找能騎的千里馬。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">內容投資</span><span class=\"tag\">播客</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"29. 逆全球化思潮來勢洶洶，外企CEO何故密集訪華？ CDR 紅籌架構 FDI 國際版\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-06-12-zhangxiaojun-外企ceo密集访华-逆全球化是政治问题-不是经济问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bb0b83ff98bdb00e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">50:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0612</span></div>\n<h2>外企CEO密集訪華：逆全球化是政治問題，不是經濟問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">逆全球化來勢洶洶卻擋不住CEO們排隊來華，因為脫鉤違反經濟規律；但真正推動脫鉤的不是經濟邏輯，而是老大防老二的政治邏輯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中美關係</span><span class=\"tag\">外資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"26. 令德國人驚嚇的上海車展：一幅當代汽車眾生圖 just in time OTA For China For China\" href=\"/podcast/p/2023-05-23-zhangxiaojun-车展最热闹的一年-也是合资品牌最危险的一年/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://image.xyzcdn.net/FunVcAKRA4iJuje884gjwhoWi5La.png?imageMogr2/thumbnail/400x/format/webp\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"張\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">張小珺·商業訪談錄</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0523</span></div>\n<h2>車展最熱鬧的一年，也是合資品牌最危險的一年</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國品牌市佔率會很快提高，合資品牌若不能給合資公司帶來價值，就可能變成獨資品牌——這是車展熱鬧背後真正的洗牌。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">汽車</span><span class=\"tag\">上海車展</span>\n</div></div></a>"]